<title>BRAZIL: Clinton to visit Brazil in 1997.</title>
<headline>Clinton to visit Brazil in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton will visit Brazil in 1997 at dates to be fixed, a U.S. Embassy spokeswoman in Brasilia said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The president will come next year but no date has yet been set,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>It was not known whether Clinton would also visit other Latin American countries.</p>
